1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:01:43,329
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:01:43,599 --> 00:01:44,040
Two.

3
00:01:44,079 --> 00:01:44,680
Zhuang Yan!

4
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:47,480
Zhuang Yan!

5
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:48,680
Put it down first!

6
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:53,959
Drop the gun on the ground!

7
00:01:56,840 --> 00:01:57,400
Drop it!

8
00:02:17,199 --> 00:02:17,919
Stop chasing!

9
00:02:25,479 --> 00:02:26,280
Are you okay?

10
00:02:28,439 --> 00:02:29,319
Are you all right?

11
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:52,800
Thank you.

12
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,840
Don't worry, miss. He'll be fine.

13
00:02:59,039 --> 00:03:01,159
Our Officer Zhuang could break three ribs

14
00:03:01,199 --> 00:03:02,319
and not even let out a whimper.

15
00:03:02,599 --> 00:03:03,439
It's fine, head on home.

16
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:08,919
Classmate Zhuang.

17
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:11,080
Not bad.

18
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,719
You're a narcotics cop now.

19
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,919
You two know each other?

20
00:03:21,400 --> 00:03:22,199
Police academy classmates.

21
00:03:22,240 --> 00:03:22,879
Good friends.

22
00:03:25,360 --> 00:03:26,280
And archrivals.

23
00:03:28,840 --> 00:03:29,879
Just ordinary classmates.

24
00:03:31,199 --> 00:03:33,120
And here I thought this was a hero saving a damsel.

25
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,879
Turns out enemies just crossed paths.

26
00:03:39,319 --> 00:03:40,199
Look, how about this?

27
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:42,879
Why don't you check with your superiors later

28
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:45,319
and ask to transfer to our narcotics squad?

29
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:47,560
That way, you can see Officer Zhuang every day

30
00:03:47,599 --> 00:03:48,759
and fight right by his side.

31
00:03:51,919 --> 00:03:55,199
Who'd want to fight by his side every day?

32
00:03:55,439 --> 00:03:56,199
It's all right, it's all right.

33
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,960
If you transfer to our squad,

34
00:03:58,120 --> 00:03:59,840
those willing to fight by your side

35
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,840
won't be in short supply.

36
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:01,800
You know why?

37
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:02,560
Because in our squad,

38
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,120
female officers are already so rare.

39
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:06,520
All we ever see every day is our captain.

40
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,199
And when she really gets tough,

41
00:04:08,199 --> 00:04:09,680
she's tougher than any man.

42
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:12,919
Captain.

43
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:17,720
Messing with me? Going undercover?

44
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,360
You usually seem so stoic, kid.

45
00:04:20,399 --> 00:04:22,279
Didn't know you were such a comedian.

46
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:29,480
Captain...

47
00:04:32,399 --> 00:04:33,120
Turn your face away.

48
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,040
Don't look at me.

49
00:04:45,199 --> 00:04:45,839
How's your injury?

50
00:04:46,519 --> 00:04:47,160
I'm fine.

51
00:04:48,519 --> 00:04:49,120
Reporting, sir!

52
00:04:49,319 --> 00:04:50,000
He's not fine.

53
00:04:50,800 --> 00:04:51,560
Who are you?

54
00:04:52,399 --> 00:04:53,199
Reporting, Captain.

55
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:55,199
He got hurt saving me.

56
00:04:55,319 --> 00:04:57,120
I'm from Nanhai Municipal Public Security Bureau,

57
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:58,439
Intelligence Division, Officer Ge Dan.

58
00:04:58,519 --> 00:04:59,560
Please step outside.

59
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:02,600
Yes, sir.

60
00:05:11,800 --> 00:05:12,720
Since you're injured,

61
00:05:13,319 --> 00:05:14,399
take a few days off to rest.

62
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:17,839
Li Xiao will stay with you.

63
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:20,399
Don't worry about the case for now.

64
00:05:20,639 --> 00:05:21,120
Captain,

65
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,319
I want to get back on duty right away.

66
00:05:23,560 --> 00:05:24,160
Captain Bai,

67
00:05:24,439 --> 00:05:25,920
I want to get back on duty right away too.

68
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,319
Turn around.

69
00:05:30,920 --> 00:05:32,279
Get back on duty?

70
00:05:32,519 --> 00:05:35,040
Today's plan was to let Wu Liang escape.

71
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,240
After Wu Liang escaped from the compound,

72
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,720
who gave you the order

73
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:40,240
to pursue him relentlessly?

74
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,360
Didn't the two of you know

75
00:05:41,399 --> 00:05:42,879
what your actual mission was?

76
00:05:46,319 --> 00:05:46,800
Captain,

77
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,240
I used to be with CID.

78
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:52,839
My duty is to catch criminals,

79
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:54,759
and I can't tolerate

80
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,920
any criminal escaping right under my nose.

81
00:05:57,439 --> 00:05:58,480
Are you saying

82
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,759
CID has never used bait operations?

83
00:06:01,079 --> 00:06:02,240
So you forced the suspect

84
00:06:02,240 --> 00:06:04,519
to open fire in a crowd and take hostages?

85
00:06:04,839 --> 00:06:05,319
Captain Bai,

86
00:06:05,319 --> 00:06:06,120
the situation back then

87
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:07,240
was actually under our control.

88
00:06:07,319 --> 00:06:08,240
Turn around.

89
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:14,079
Going beyond the perimeter is "under control"?

90
00:06:17,319 --> 00:06:20,480
If the suspect had injured civilians or hostages,

91
00:06:20,759 --> 00:06:22,560
how could the department answer to the public?

92
00:06:22,839 --> 00:06:23,519
Do you have any idea

93
00:06:23,519 --> 00:06:25,120
what kind of mistake you made,

94
00:06:25,360 --> 00:06:26,759
or what the consequences could have been?

95
00:06:26,959 --> 00:06:28,199
Did you even think about that?

96
00:06:35,399 --> 00:06:36,439
Regarding what happened today,

97
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:38,639
I want both of you to take a hard look at yourselves.

98
00:06:39,199 --> 00:06:40,439
As your superior,

99
00:06:40,759 --> 00:06:42,480
I believe your emotional control

100
00:06:42,519 --> 00:06:43,600
has become a serious problem.

101
00:06:44,319 --> 00:06:45,279
Within a week,

102
00:06:45,639 --> 00:06:47,480
both of you go see a psychologist.

103
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:50,680
I want a detailed psychological evaluation report.

104
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:53,079
I don't need to see a doctor.

105
00:06:53,199 --> 00:06:53,680
Captain Bai,

106
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,040
I don't need to see one either.

107
00:06:55,279 --> 00:06:56,319
I need—

108
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,000
No.

109
00:07:06,959 --> 00:07:07,439
Captain Bai,

110
00:07:08,040 --> 00:07:09,199
if staying in Narcotics

111
00:07:09,319 --> 00:07:11,319
requires a psychological evaluation,

112
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,360
I'd rather transfer back to CID.

113
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,600
Come whenever you want,

114
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,839
leave whenever you want?

115
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:20,920
You think the Narcotics Brigade is your home?

116
00:07:22,199 --> 00:07:23,279
Zero discipline!

117
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:25,720
Captain Bai!

118
00:07:26,560 --> 00:07:27,879
Wu Liang just hijacked a motorcycle

119
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,680
and headed toward Guangming Electronics in the west.

120
00:07:30,560 --> 00:07:32,639
I had Guan Qiang's team set up a perimeter first.

121
00:07:32,680 --> 00:07:34,360
CID will be there shortly.

122
00:07:36,040 --> 00:07:36,600
Let's move.

123
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:39,319
Captain Bai,

124
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,120
Zhuang Yan and I

125
00:07:41,639 --> 00:07:42,680
have clashed with Wu Liang twice.

126
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,480
I believe

127
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:45,519
we know Wu Liang better than anyone else.

128
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:46,920
Can we join you

129
00:07:46,920 --> 00:07:48,240
to finish this mission

130
00:07:48,279 --> 00:07:49,160
before being suspended?

131
00:07:53,759 --> 00:07:55,360
Did I say you were suspended?

132
00:07:57,639 --> 00:07:59,759
Let me repeat your assignment right now.

133
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,399
You, Zhuang Yan.

134
00:08:01,839 --> 00:08:03,160
Rest and recover.

135
00:08:03,399 --> 00:08:04,360
You, Li Xiao.

136
00:08:04,560 --> 00:08:05,839
Help Zhuang Yan recover.

137
00:08:07,480 --> 00:08:08,600
If there's a new assignment,

138
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:10,240
I'll let you know.

139
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:12,759
And don't forget:

140
00:08:13,879 --> 00:08:15,360
the psychological evaluations.

141
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,160
Captain...

142
00:08:21,519 --> 00:08:22,079
Actually, I...

143
00:08:22,079 --> 00:08:23,879
Stay behind and help them take statements.

144
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:25,399
Captain,

145
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,279
there's one more thing.

146
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,680
Zhuang Yan and I went to the same police academy,

147
00:08:28,800 --> 00:08:29,959
and I've always wanted to be on the front line.

148
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,839
That's why I'm applying to join Narcotics.

149
00:08:39,840 --> 00:08:40,360
First,

150
00:08:40,519 --> 00:08:42,159
you have no front line combat experience.

151
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,000
Second,

152
00:08:43,679 --> 00:08:44,720
improper procedure.

153
00:09:06,519 --> 00:09:06,799
Captain Bai.

154
00:09:06,960 --> 00:09:07,240
Captain Lu.

155
00:09:07,679 --> 00:09:08,200
What's the situation?

156
00:09:08,639 --> 00:09:10,000
The suspect circled the city several times.

157
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,000
Half an hour ago,

158
00:09:11,279 --> 00:09:12,519
he entered the building across the street.

159
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,879
Our team and the CID officers

160
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,080
have taken up positions

161
00:09:15,279 --> 00:09:15,799
to secure the perimeter.

162
00:09:16,799 --> 00:09:17,919
Are there any usable surveillance cameras?

163
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:18,320
Yes.

164
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:19,679
But they haven't been used in a long time.

165
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:20,639
We're working on them now.

166
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:22,559
How much longer?

167
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,840
Half an hour at most.

168
00:09:25,120 --> 00:09:26,080
After the electronics plant relocated,

169
00:09:26,080 --> 00:09:27,919
the dorms haven't been renovated yet.

170
00:09:28,159 --> 00:09:29,879
All the rooms are currently vacant.

171
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:32,159
The suspect is located right here.

172
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:02,320
I have the goods now.

173
00:10:02,559 --> 00:10:04,120
Cut the crap.

174
00:10:04,960 --> 00:10:05,960
Get the cash ready,

175
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,200
and sit tight for my call.

176
00:10:08,639 --> 00:10:09,600
Did I hear wrong,

177
00:10:09,679 --> 00:10:10,879
or did you remember it wrong?

178
00:10:11,519 --> 00:10:13,240
I remember Boss Ma said otherwise.

179
00:10:13,360 --> 00:10:15,080
We get the goods first,

180
00:10:15,240 --> 00:10:15,919
and then transfer the money

181
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,840
into Boss Ma's designated account.

182
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:19,960
Don't you understand what I'm saying?

183
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:23,240
The goods are in my hands now.

184
00:10:23,519 --> 00:10:26,200
If you want the goods, you pay me directly.

185
00:10:26,279 --> 00:10:27,600
Do you understand?

186
00:10:29,879 --> 00:10:30,919
Your boss's goods...

187
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:32,840
Are you sure you can swallow them?

188
00:10:33,080 --> 00:10:34,639
So what if I can't?

189
00:10:35,879 --> 00:10:37,960
I know you need this shipment urgently.

190
00:10:38,759 --> 00:10:40,600
Aren't you begging me right now?

191
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,159
I'll wait for your call.

192
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,480
Fine.

193
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:59,039
The suspect could make the trade at any moment.

194
00:10:59,919 --> 00:11:01,440
We only get one shot.

195
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:02,759
Alert all units.

196
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:04,000
Be ready to move at any time.

197
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:04,639
Copy that.

198
00:11:08,279 --> 00:11:10,639
Boss, should we give Boss Ma a call?

199
00:11:41,480 --> 00:11:41,960
Xiao Ding,

200
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,840
send the photos of the two deceased

201
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:44,639
to the Provincial Department.

202
00:11:44,720 --> 00:11:46,440
Have them verify with Interpol.

203
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,240
Also,

204
00:11:47,559 --> 00:11:49,799
cross-check their accomplices' identities.

205
00:11:49,879 --> 00:11:50,320
Copy that.

206
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,759
No, I have to get back to the team.

207
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:00,720
You can't leave.

208
00:12:00,759 --> 00:12:01,440
Why not?

209
00:12:02,039 --> 00:12:03,559
Your captain just told me to keep an eye on you two.

210
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,759
Besides, if you leave,

211
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:11,120
leaving a man and a woman alone in a room...

212
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,320
That wouldn't look good.

213
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,960
Wait, in what capacity are you even staying here?

214
00:12:17,960 --> 00:12:19,159
You're a victim,

215
00:12:19,200 --> 00:12:20,200
and Zhuang Yan's classmate.

216
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:21,840
Fine, say you're our colleague,

217
00:12:21,840 --> 00:12:23,320
but you're not on the narcotics squad.

218
00:12:23,399 --> 00:12:24,679
You have no authority over us.

219
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:25,799
Yeah,

220
00:12:25,919 --> 00:12:27,240
I'm not on your team right now,

221
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,559
but in the near future,

222
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:30,320
I'll definitely be on the same team as you.

223
00:12:32,480 --> 00:12:33,200
Oh really?

224
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:34,879
You want to join Narcotics?

225
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:35,919
Yeah.

226
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:40,159
Didn't I tell you before?

227
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,559
Ever since I was a kid,

228
00:12:41,759 --> 00:12:43,000
my dream has been to become a police officer,

229
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:45,000
to protect everyone around me.

230
00:12:45,639 --> 00:12:47,320
It's just that after graduating from the academy,

231
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:49,279
I was assigned to a desk job at the bureau.

232
00:12:50,559 --> 00:12:52,039
I've never been to the front line.

233
00:12:53,279 --> 00:12:54,759
So I must get out to the front line,

234
00:12:55,159 --> 00:12:56,639
to put my life on the line with you guys.

235
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,159
Cut it out.

236
00:13:04,320 --> 00:13:05,279
Did you find anything?

237
00:13:05,679 --> 00:13:07,559
Chief Huang, what brings you here?

238
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,200
You're putting your lives on the line out here.

239
00:13:10,279 --> 00:13:11,720
I couldn't just sit still back at headquarters.

240
00:13:12,320 --> 00:13:12,960
Captain Bai,

241
00:13:13,320 --> 00:13:13,919
we've got something.

242
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:24,480
Did you get frontal photos of these three?

243
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:27,679
Got them. Sending them over right away.

244
00:13:29,159 --> 00:13:29,679
Captain Lu,

245
00:13:29,799 --> 00:13:31,320
run a background check on these three.

246
00:13:31,320 --> 00:13:31,879
On it.

247
00:13:57,639 --> 00:13:58,639
So you're Lao Jin.

248
00:13:59,080 --> 00:14:01,000
Our brother died at your hands.

249
00:14:01,240 --> 00:14:02,519
You've got some nerve calling me.

250
00:14:03,639 --> 00:14:05,440
Your brother was in the same boat as me.

251
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,840
He was killed by the cops.

252
00:14:11,159 --> 00:14:13,039
You got our brother killed,

253
00:14:13,039 --> 00:14:14,799
and now you want us to get on board?

254
00:14:16,639 --> 00:14:18,039
Why should we trust you?

255
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,720
The cops are looking for you right now.

256
00:14:22,279 --> 00:14:23,480
You need money.

257
00:14:43,559 --> 00:14:45,080
In a few days, someone's making a deal with me.

258
00:14:45,679 --> 00:14:46,480
Once I get the cash,

259
00:14:47,879 --> 00:14:48,919
you'll each get a cut,

260
00:14:50,639 --> 00:14:51,879
enough for you to skip town.

261
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:59,279
You could just take the cash and run yourself.

262
00:15:00,279 --> 00:15:01,919
Why split it with us?

263
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,279
I want to stay alive.

264
00:15:12,159 --> 00:15:14,000
Wu Liang sure is cunning.

265
00:15:15,200 --> 00:15:17,600
Finding new accomplices so quickly.

266
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:22,919
Chief Huang.

267
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:23,559
Captain Bai.

268
00:15:24,679 --> 00:15:25,720
Interpol just sent over

269
00:15:25,720 --> 00:15:26,799
the files on three suspects.

270
00:15:27,279 --> 00:15:28,279
Just like the two dead men before,

271
00:15:29,080 --> 00:15:30,200
they're all international fugitives.

272
00:15:33,200 --> 00:15:34,559
Every single one a desperado.

273
00:15:35,320 --> 00:15:37,320
Then we can take them all down in one sweep.

274
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,159
Don't worry.

275
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,279
Once we get the money,

276
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:06,320
your cut

277
00:16:06,559 --> 00:16:07,240
won't be a penny less.

278
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:10,679
Survive first, then we'll talk.

279
00:16:22,399 --> 00:16:23,879
Captain, the three of them showed up.

280
00:16:24,799 --> 00:16:26,440
Captain Lu, tail them with Guan Qiang.

281
00:16:26,639 --> 00:16:27,159
Copy that.

282
00:16:55,879 --> 00:16:56,919
Working out right after getting hurt?

283
00:16:57,519 --> 00:16:58,600
Careful you don't wreck yourself.

284
00:16:59,600 --> 00:17:00,519
Aren't you doing the same?

285
00:17:01,440 --> 00:17:02,840
A suspect hit you over the head, too.

286
00:17:03,279 --> 00:17:04,160
If you're not scared,

287
00:17:04,319 --> 00:17:05,240
why should I be?

288
00:17:06,680 --> 00:17:08,039
You know, being cops,

289
00:17:08,640 --> 00:17:10,759
our lives are on the line on every mission,

290
00:17:11,359 --> 00:17:13,279
and if something goes wrong, we get penalized.

291
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:15,599
If you don't like it, quit.

292
00:17:15,960 --> 00:17:17,039
Quit your whining.

293
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:27,480
If there's really an issue with our psych evaluation,

294
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:29,000
they won't transfer us to a desk job, will they?

295
00:17:29,359 --> 00:17:31,680
I couldn't stand sitting in an office every day.

296
00:17:36,079 --> 00:17:37,319
If Captain Bai really does that,

297
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,440
I'll apply to transfer back to Criminal Investigation.

298
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:43,480
No matter what, I'm staying on the front line.

299
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:55,400
The three suspects, including Lao Jin,

300
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:57,440
along with the two previously shot dead,

301
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:59,880
are the killers in the "April 9" Major Homicide Case.

302
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:01,319
Interpol

303
00:18:01,319 --> 00:18:03,599
has formally sent us an official request,

304
00:18:03,599 --> 00:18:06,160
urging the prompt arrest of the three suspects.

305
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:13,839
The three have frequently driven out lately,

306
00:18:14,279 --> 00:18:16,200
likely scouting a favorable spot for the deal.

307
00:18:16,519 --> 00:18:19,759
Qin Hao cut off two of Wu Liang's fingers before,

308
00:18:20,079 --> 00:18:21,680
so during the next deal,

309
00:18:22,240 --> 00:18:23,480
Wu Liang will likely be extra cautious.

310
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:26,519
Qin Hao is one of the biggest drug lords in Nanhai.

311
00:18:27,119 --> 00:18:28,559
To take down his criminal syndicate,

312
00:18:28,799 --> 00:18:29,920
we must catch them red-handed with the goods.

313
00:18:30,559 --> 00:18:32,039
Only by moving in during the deal

314
00:18:32,079 --> 00:18:33,359
and rounding them all up at once

315
00:18:33,440 --> 00:18:35,359
can our operation be deemed a success.

316
00:18:35,920 --> 00:18:37,400
The undercover agent is gathering evidence.

317
00:18:38,720 --> 00:18:40,440
Make sure the undercover stays safe at all costs.

318
00:18:40,640 --> 00:18:42,279
The suspects are growing restless.

319
00:18:42,640 --> 00:18:43,599
Then let's turn up the heat

320
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:46,440
and push them to deal with Qin Hao soon,

321
00:18:46,759 --> 00:18:48,160
so we can take them all down quickly.

322
00:18:48,880 --> 00:18:49,400
Understood.

323
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:55,400
How are Zhuang Yan and Li Xiao doing lately?

324
00:18:56,759 --> 00:18:58,200
During the operation,

325
00:18:58,359 --> 00:18:59,599
they were indeed exceptionally valiant,

326
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:02,640
but they were also overly aggressive.

327
00:19:04,000 --> 00:19:06,480
Plus, Zhuang Yan was injured earlier.

328
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:09,079
Aside from having them write self-reviews,

329
00:19:09,240 --> 00:19:11,160
I also wanted them both to get some rest.

330
00:19:13,559 --> 00:19:14,720
Those two youngsters...

331
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:16,240
they've got a lot of drive,

332
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:18,480
just like I did back in the day.

333
00:19:20,519 --> 00:19:22,359
When do you plan to bring them back?

334
00:19:22,960 --> 00:19:25,039
I sent them for psychological evaluations.

335
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:27,359
There are a few concerns to clarify,

336
00:19:27,880 --> 00:19:30,519
so I want to see the report

337
00:19:31,200 --> 00:19:32,000
before making a decision.

338
00:19:43,599 --> 00:19:45,240
An invalid psychological evaluation.

339
00:19:46,279 --> 00:19:47,599
Can you give me an explanation?

340
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:55,799
Zhuang Yan.

341
00:19:57,279 --> 00:19:58,759
A qualified police officer,

342
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:00,559
at all times

343
00:20:01,039 --> 00:20:02,559
and under any pressure,

344
00:20:03,119 --> 00:20:04,319
should always stay calm.

345
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:07,200
On the day of the Qinyi Garden operation,

346
00:20:07,359 --> 00:20:08,559
you knew full well what a decoy operation

347
00:20:08,559 --> 00:20:09,519
entailed.

348
00:20:09,759 --> 00:20:10,599
Why did you

349
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:14,079
suddenly lose control of your emotions

350
00:20:14,359 --> 00:20:16,119
and relentlessly pursue the suspect?

351
00:20:16,440 --> 00:20:17,920
Can you tell me the truth?

352
00:20:39,880 --> 00:20:42,880
Given that your psych evaluation is invalid,

353
00:20:43,519 --> 00:20:45,400
and regarding your extreme behavior,

354
00:20:45,559 --> 00:20:47,440
you can't give me a reasonable explanation,

355
00:20:47,759 --> 00:20:48,920
I think that right now,

356
00:20:49,079 --> 00:20:50,720
you're unfit to stay on the front line.

357
00:20:53,039 --> 00:20:54,079
Transfer to another post.

358
00:20:55,519 --> 00:20:57,319
While you remain a part

359
00:20:57,319 --> 00:20:58,359
of Operation Thunderbolt,

360
00:20:59,240 --> 00:21:00,519
starting today,

361
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:02,640
you'll be organizing case files.

362
00:21:05,680 --> 00:21:06,319
That's an order.

363
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:17,799
Captain Lu wants us on-site to relieve our colleagues.

364
00:21:21,079 --> 00:21:21,799
Hurry up!

365
00:21:27,400 --> 00:21:29,519
These are the wiretap logs and case analyses.

366
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:31,480
Captain Bai wants you to organize these files

367
00:21:31,519 --> 00:21:32,599
and take them to Archives for filing.

368
00:22:17,519 --> 00:22:18,319
What's the situation?

369
00:22:19,880 --> 00:22:22,000
Guan Qiang is still tailing the three suspects.

370
00:22:22,279 --> 00:22:23,279
Li Xiao went to monitor surveillance.

371
00:22:25,240 --> 00:22:26,440
As for Zhuang Yan,

372
00:22:26,960 --> 00:22:28,160
what's going on with him?

373
00:22:33,240 --> 00:22:35,200
An invalid psychological evaluation report.

374
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,359
I had him organize the case files.

375
00:22:41,440 --> 00:22:43,839
Didn't he give you any explanation?

376
00:22:44,400 --> 00:22:45,000
Nope.

377
00:22:46,680 --> 00:22:47,319
Then are you still having him

378
00:22:47,519 --> 00:22:48,599
follow up on Wu Liang's case?

379
00:22:49,200 --> 00:22:49,799
Of course.

380
00:22:52,000 --> 00:22:53,039
Just like you said,

381
00:22:53,200 --> 00:22:54,720
he's exceptionally capable.

382
00:22:55,599 --> 00:22:57,759
A talent who can fool a psych evaluation,

383
00:22:57,759 --> 00:22:59,440
how could I easily let him go?

384
00:23:01,519 --> 00:23:02,759
But I think

385
00:23:04,799 --> 00:23:06,720
he's fully aware of his own issues.

386
00:23:07,119 --> 00:23:08,960
So it's not a personality flaw,

387
00:23:09,119 --> 00:23:10,119
it's a psychological block.

388
00:23:10,960 --> 00:23:12,599
And through his words and actions,

389
00:23:12,720 --> 00:23:13,759
he deliberately conceals it.

390
00:23:14,359 --> 00:23:15,759
So we have to give him a chance

391
00:23:16,279 --> 00:23:17,759
to help him overcome this obstacle.

392
00:23:19,319 --> 00:23:20,839
But knowing him as I do,

393
00:23:21,119 --> 00:23:22,279
with his temper,

394
00:23:22,599 --> 00:23:24,079
how could he ever accept this?

395
00:23:24,279 --> 00:23:25,279
I told him it's an order.

396
00:23:31,319 --> 00:23:32,559
Why did you want to be a cop?

397
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:38,160
To protect the people I want to protect.

398
00:24:04,279 --> 00:24:05,160
Someone's coming.

399
00:24:40,279 --> 00:24:41,920
Here, brought you some food.

400
00:24:48,200 --> 00:24:49,359
Nobody tailed you, right?

401
00:24:50,079 --> 00:24:52,079
Don't worry. We circled around

402
00:24:52,279 --> 00:24:53,599
and made sure it was safe before heading here.

403
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:57,960
The cops are looking for us everywhere.

404
00:24:58,200 --> 00:25:00,400
Every day we wait means more danger.

405
00:25:01,000 --> 00:25:01,960
If this goes on,

406
00:25:02,359 --> 00:25:03,279
I'm afraid

407
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,319
none of us will make it out of Nanhai.

408
00:25:04,440 --> 00:25:05,039
Yeah, Brother Liang.

409
00:25:05,200 --> 00:25:06,519
What are we waiting for anyway?

410
00:25:07,119 --> 00:25:09,000
Did you do what I told you?

411
00:25:11,680 --> 00:25:12,559
It's all arranged.

412
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:14,359
Just waiting to get the money from Qin Hao.

413
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:20,839
Right now, the whole city is plastered

414
00:25:20,839 --> 00:25:22,119
with wanted posters of us.

415
00:25:22,920 --> 00:25:24,160
We can't wait any longer.

416
00:25:30,880 --> 00:25:32,119
Cornered dogs are bound to get desperate.

417
00:25:35,279 --> 00:25:36,599
They can't sit tight anymore.

418
00:25:57,680 --> 00:25:58,839
You're pretty early today.

419
00:25:59,119 --> 00:26:00,279
It's not even midnight yet.

420
00:26:01,279 --> 00:26:02,599
Why are you only doing dishes now?

421
00:26:04,079 --> 00:26:05,440
We were going to eat earlier,

422
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:07,599
but Huanhuan insisted on waiting for you.

423
00:26:08,400 --> 00:26:09,880
She waited until ten,

424
00:26:10,119 --> 00:26:10,920
and you still weren't back.

425
00:26:11,799 --> 00:26:13,079
I saw she was starving,

426
00:26:13,240 --> 00:26:14,440
and I just got her to sleep.

427
00:26:34,240 --> 00:26:35,039
Look...

428
00:26:35,799 --> 00:26:36,640
I'm sorry.

429
00:26:37,480 --> 00:26:39,200
I've been on assignments lately.

430
00:26:39,519 --> 00:26:40,799
When are you ever not on duty?

431
00:26:40,960 --> 00:26:41,759
Just because you have assignments,

432
00:26:41,759 --> 00:26:43,000
does that mean you can forget this family

433
00:26:43,279 --> 00:26:45,160
and forget you have a daughter?

434
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:47,279
Have you ever considered

435
00:26:47,799 --> 00:26:50,640
that you might be a qualified police officer,

436
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:52,680
but as a mother,

437
00:26:53,119 --> 00:26:54,440
you've failed completely?

438
00:26:55,160 --> 00:26:56,440
How can you say that?

439
00:26:57,160 --> 00:26:59,079
Do you ever consider my feelings?

440
00:26:59,559 --> 00:27:00,880
I don't even care anymore.

441
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,440
But could you please not forget

442
00:27:03,160 --> 00:27:04,720
that you still have a daughter?

443
00:27:06,319 --> 00:27:07,319
Huanhuan is already six years old.

444
00:27:07,759 --> 00:27:08,640
Even now,

445
00:27:09,440 --> 00:27:10,799
she keeps calling you Captain Bai

446
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:12,200
and rarely calls you Mom.

447
00:27:13,119 --> 00:27:14,519
Don't you want to know why?

448
00:27:21,319 --> 00:27:22,160
I'm sorry...

449
00:27:24,119 --> 00:27:25,440
You don't need to apologize to me.

450
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:27,920
The one you owe an apology to is our daughter.

451
00:27:28,920 --> 00:27:29,680
To her,

452
00:27:30,279 --> 00:27:32,680
you've been completely absent as a mother.

453
00:27:34,720 --> 00:27:36,319
As long as you remain a cop,

454
00:27:36,799 --> 00:27:38,680
your heart will never be at home.

455
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:41,440
I think

456
00:27:42,319 --> 00:27:43,480
it's time for you

457
00:27:43,640 --> 00:27:45,440
between work and family

458
00:27:45,880 --> 00:27:47,079
to finally make a choice.

459
00:27:50,039 --> 00:27:51,599
How do you want me to choose?

460
00:27:51,839 --> 00:27:53,200
This family needs you.

461
00:27:54,319 --> 00:27:55,480
I need you.

462
00:27:56,480 --> 00:27:57,880
And Huanhuan needs you even more.

463
00:28:11,400 --> 00:28:13,319
All right, I'll be right there.

464
00:28:18,400 --> 00:28:20,240
There's an emergency.

465
00:28:20,400 --> 00:28:21,440
I have to get over there right away.

466
00:28:23,440 --> 00:28:24,519
About our situation,

467
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:26,319
let's talk about it another time.

468
00:28:28,279 --> 00:28:30,119
Can't you eat before you leave?

469
00:28:31,720 --> 00:28:32,519
There's no time.

470
00:28:36,119 --> 00:28:37,119
Captain Bai.

471
00:28:39,359 --> 00:28:40,359
Captain Bai.

472
00:28:41,079 --> 00:28:42,119
Huanhuan.

473
00:28:42,799 --> 00:28:44,160
Why aren't you asleep yet?

474
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:47,640
I just wanted to see you before going to sleep.

475
00:28:50,559 --> 00:28:51,839
Mommy will be back soon.

476
00:28:52,920 --> 00:28:53,839
Give Mommy a hug.

477
00:29:01,319 --> 00:29:03,119
Come here, come to Daddy.

478
00:29:09,079 --> 00:29:09,799
Go ahead.

479
00:29:10,359 --> 00:29:11,160
Be careful out there.

480
00:29:12,319 --> 00:29:14,039
Stay safe.

481
00:29:16,599 --> 00:29:17,279
I will.

482
00:29:27,440 --> 00:29:28,240
You tired?

483
00:29:28,680 --> 00:29:29,799
Let's go to bed.

484
00:29:30,720 --> 00:29:31,559
Come on.

485
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:45,240
Wu Liang suddenly said he's dealing with Qin Hao.

486
00:29:46,079 --> 00:29:47,359
We're heading to the deal location now.

487
00:29:47,680 --> 00:29:49,400
Li Xiao and He Bo are tailing Wu Liang.

488
00:29:49,839 --> 00:29:51,680
The criminal police unit is on standby for backup.

489
00:30:06,039 --> 00:30:07,079
In ten minutes,

490
00:30:07,200 --> 00:30:08,240
call Qin Hao again.

491
00:30:08,839 --> 00:30:10,240
Tell him we're changing the deal location.

492
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:13,200
If we do this,

493
00:30:13,400 --> 00:30:14,880
will they call off the deal?

494
00:30:15,359 --> 00:30:17,039
Qin Hao's buyer is pressing him hard.

495
00:30:18,200 --> 00:30:19,279
Tonight,

496
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:21,680
he has to get this shipment.

497
00:30:35,240 --> 00:30:36,599
Wu Liang said he's worried the cops might tail us,

498
00:30:36,799 --> 00:30:38,640
so he wants us to go after six at daybreak.

499
00:30:38,960 --> 00:30:40,319
Changed the spot to Wulihe Road.

500
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:41,759
Fine.

501
00:30:42,000 --> 00:30:43,720
If he wants to play games, we'll play along.

502
00:30:44,359 --> 00:30:46,759
Tell A-Li to keep an eye out for any cars tailing us.

503
00:30:46,960 --> 00:30:47,559
Understood.

504
00:31:00,279 --> 00:31:00,720
Captain Bai.

505
00:31:00,839 --> 00:31:03,279
Wu Liang changed the deal location to Wulihe Road again.

506
00:31:05,279 --> 00:31:06,720
Wu Liang never had

507
00:31:06,720 --> 00:31:08,839
Sanlang and A-Hei scout Wulihe Road before.

508
00:31:10,000 --> 00:31:11,839
Looks like another feint.

509
00:31:14,119 --> 00:31:14,960
All units, be advised.

510
00:31:15,279 --> 00:31:17,079
Keep your distance from the suspect vehicle.

511
00:31:17,240 --> 00:31:17,920
Don't blow your cover.

512
00:31:28,000 --> 00:31:28,640
Captain Bai.

513
00:31:28,960 --> 00:31:30,640
The suspect's vehicle stopped at Dongfeng Bridge.

514
00:31:37,119 --> 00:31:37,680
Criminal Police,

515
00:31:37,799 --> 00:31:39,720
stop all vehicles heading to Dongfeng Bridge.

516
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:41,200
Our team, get ready to move.

517
00:32:14,960 --> 00:32:15,960
Give the money to Ah Li.

518
00:32:16,880 --> 00:32:18,160
Have him come over himself.

519
00:32:21,039 --> 00:32:23,240
How can I trust you if I haven't seen the goods?

520
00:32:34,119 --> 00:32:35,720
Alright, wait right there.

521
00:33:25,319 --> 00:33:27,079
Boss, I got the goods.

522
00:33:28,119 --> 00:33:28,960
Take him out.

523
00:33:42,240 --> 00:33:42,759
Move out!

524
00:34:01,920 --> 00:34:02,519
Boss!

525
00:34:09,800 --> 00:34:11,079
Boss, it's the cops! Run!

526
00:34:11,199 --> 00:34:11,719
Fall back!

527
00:34:26,000 --> 00:34:27,360
The cops are here! Let's go!

528
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:47,559
Track the location! Send urgent backup, fast!

529
00:35:11,920 --> 00:35:13,519
Boss, get out and run!

530
00:35:15,239 --> 00:35:16,280
Hurry, get up there, Boss!

531
00:35:59,960 --> 00:36:00,639
Reporting, Captain Bai.

532
00:36:00,840 --> 00:36:03,079
Li Xiao and He Bo tracked Wu Liang to Xidao Fishing Village.

533
00:36:03,079 --> 00:36:03,800
Requesting backup.

534
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:04,480
On our way.

535
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:05,480
Get him to the hospital.

536
00:36:05,639 --> 00:36:06,559
Yes, sir. Let's go.

537
00:36:13,840 --> 00:36:14,719
Split up.

538
00:36:25,559 --> 00:36:26,079
Get out of the car.

539
00:37:03,800 --> 00:37:04,400
Move!

540
00:37:06,440 --> 00:37:07,719
It's a police ambush!

541
00:37:08,280 --> 00:37:10,119
Have they been onto me all along?

542
00:38:05,159 --> 00:38:05,599
Over here!

543
00:38:07,400 --> 00:38:08,000
Don't move!

544
00:38:08,480 --> 00:38:09,039
Freeze!

545
00:38:41,440 --> 00:38:42,280
That scared the hell out of me.

546
00:38:46,440 --> 00:38:47,480
Cops are everywhere outside.

547
00:38:47,719 --> 00:38:49,199
If we stay here, we're dead.

548
00:38:52,599 --> 00:38:53,559
Let's take a gamble.

549
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:54,719
Split up.

550
00:38:54,719 --> 00:38:56,119
Maybe one of us will survive.

551
00:38:56,400 --> 00:38:57,199
You...

552
00:39:03,440 --> 00:39:04,960
Your brother gave his life for this.

553
00:39:05,239 --> 00:39:05,960
Take it.

554
00:39:08,920 --> 00:39:09,440
Take care.

555
00:39:28,400 --> 00:39:30,599
Captain Bai, the suspect is moving fast.

556
00:39:33,960 --> 00:39:34,440
This way!

557
00:40:13,159 --> 00:40:14,079
Right ahead! Hurry!

558
00:40:14,079 --> 00:40:14,639
After them!

559
00:40:33,119 --> 00:40:33,840
Freeze!

560
00:40:47,480 --> 00:40:48,199
Ding Tao?

561
00:40:48,800 --> 00:40:49,599
Why isn't it Wu Liang?

562
00:40:49,679 --> 00:40:51,280
The GPS shows he's right here.

563
00:40:51,840 --> 00:40:52,280
Search the place.

564
00:41:04,239 --> 00:41:04,960
Captain.

565
00:41:31,039 --> 00:41:32,239
Starting tomorrow,

566
00:41:33,400 --> 00:41:35,960
Captain Lu will lead a team to West Suburb Fishing Village

567
00:41:36,119 --> 00:41:38,880
and scour the surrounding area for Wu Liang's whereabouts.

568
00:41:39,159 --> 00:41:40,400
The drugs in Wu Liang's possession

569
00:41:41,639 --> 00:41:43,400
came from the Ring Expressway arson case,

570
00:41:43,400 --> 00:41:45,199
obtained directly from the suspect.

571
00:41:46,559 --> 00:41:48,360
Li Xiao, He Bo,

572
00:41:48,519 --> 00:41:50,559
you two follow up on this lead.

573
00:41:50,880 --> 00:41:53,239
Track down the white Volkswagen CC from the scene,

574
00:41:53,440 --> 00:41:55,280
and try to find Wu Liang's supplier.

575
00:41:56,159 --> 00:41:56,960
Guan Qiang,

576
00:41:57,639 --> 00:41:58,519
I want you to check

577
00:41:58,639 --> 00:42:01,679
the three months before Xiangdu Entertainment Club closed,

578
00:42:01,679 --> 00:42:03,519
and get the entry and exit logs for everyone.

579
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:04,440
Yes, sir.

580
00:42:14,199 --> 00:42:14,840
Dismissed.

581
00:42:35,440 --> 00:42:36,159
Don't worry.

582
00:42:37,719 --> 00:42:38,920
This operation

583
00:42:39,599 --> 00:42:41,440
isn't just about Nanhai's drug network.

584
00:42:45,000 --> 00:42:46,519
I now think what we've uncovered

585
00:42:46,519 --> 00:42:48,159
might just be the tip of the iceberg.

586
00:42:55,079 --> 00:42:57,239
Then we'll dig under that iceberg

587
00:42:57,559 --> 00:43:00,199
and root out every single drug dealer.

588
00:43:11,199 --> 00:43:11,880
Captain.

589
00:43:13,679 --> 00:43:14,719
I want to get back to the front line.
